docs: normalize proxy client params to always use 'q'

- Add explicit comments documenting param normalization
- Client (placesProxy.ts) always uses 'q' parameter
- Server (places-search.ts) accepts both 'q' (normalized) and 'query' (legacy)
- Maintains backward compatibility
- No breaking changes

Files changed:
- src/lib/google/placesProxy.ts: Document 'q' param usage
- api/places-search.ts: Document backward compatibility
- PROXY_PARAMS_NORMALIZED.md: Complete documentation
